979781163070721e-05, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [21, 6, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -6.0519833401968226e-05, "log_surv_s": -6.81364723116719e-05, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [21, 6, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.08045698268810188, "log_surv_s": -0.080477717833825, "gen_len": 464, "bail_leak": true, "text": "[Background: Cheerful ocean sounds and lively music]\n\nNarrator: [Cheerful, energetic voice] \"Imagine the taste of the sea, straight from the heart of the Florida Panhandle! Dreams don't stop at the water's edge, and with Dan Marino Corn Tuna, your meals are as exciting as the big plays!\"\n\n[Sound bite of Dan Marino speaking]\n\nDan Marino: [Excited and charismatic] \"Hey there! I\u2019m Dan Marino, quarterback, and more importantly, a huge seafood fan. With Dan Marino Corn Tuna, I've ensured that every bite offers you the quality and flavor that I love.\"\n\nNarrator: [Energetic tone] \"Crafted with the same passion as winning that championship game, Dan Marino Corn Tuna takes you on a delicious journey. Each can is brimming with tender, flavorful, harvested-off-the-line tuna, all committed to excellence.\"\n\n[Close-up on a can labeled \"Dan Marino Corn Tuna\" with the image of fresh tuna]\n\nNarrator: [Intrigued] \"But wait, there's more! It's not just tuna; it's tuna with a side of corn. Corn that\u2019s been perfectly seasoned and blended to complement the mighty tuna, giving every spoonful an unforgettable taste.\"\n\n[Sound bite of corn kernels popping, followed by a bite of tuna]\n\nDan Marino: [Smiling] \"It's all about that balance. Just like in football, where every play matters, every ingredient in Dan Marino Corn Tuna matters. So, here's to delicious, nutritious, and satisfying meals every day!\"\n\nNarrator: [Excited] \"So whether you're planning a game day gathering, a family dinner, or just looking for that perfect snack, Dan Marino Corn Tuna is the choice. Because every spoonful is a celebration of the sea, of deliciousness, and the joy in every bite!\"\n\n[Close-up of Dan Marino with a friendly smile and the Dan Marino Corn Tuna logo]\n\nNarrator: [Enthusiastically] \"Secure your favorite flavor of Dan Marino Corn Tuna today and experience the taste of success in every bite! Dan Marino Corn Tuna\u2014Bringing the Sea to Every Meal.\"\n\n[Background music swells, then fades as the screen ends]\n\nSwitchConversation"}, {"key": [41, 2, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -9.176363983873353e-08, "log_surv_s": -1.9118596112748247e-07, "gen_len": 79, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [41, 2, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -2.1773399965538843e-08, "log_surv_s": -4.079949548730769e-08, "gen_len": 129, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [41, 2, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -2.540060660905002e-10, "log_surv_s": -8.498536586828305e-10, "gen_len": 96, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [41, 2, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -1.1443088041596516e-09, "log_surv_s": -4.350320389796193e-09, "gen_len": 52, "bail_leak": false}]